letter.en:
Hi everyone,

Vardahei IT, who help us with IT, would like to know what IT security looks like in our everyday work: which routines we have, how we keep track of passwords and sign-ins, and what we do if something goes wrong.

The questions are the same as last round, so we can see what has changed. You enter your initials first; apart from that there are no names. Only Vardahei IT sees answers per person, and the company gets an overall picture. It takes about {minutt} minutes, and “not sure” is a perfectly fine answer.

{lenkje}

The link goes to {host}, so it's safe to open.{frist}

Thanks!

